WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.531 --> 00:00:03.835
PETER QUILL
Last night I had a dream...

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:05.703
...about when we first met.

00:00:09.194 --> 00:00:10.335
We were criminals.

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:12.094
Friends.

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:14.054
And then we became Guardians.

00:00:17.297 --> 00:00:18.421
This is the end of the road.

00:00:18.472 --> 00:00:19.679
ROCKET
Let's make it count.

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:20.724
GROOT
We...

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:22.075
...are...

00:00:22.126 --> 00:00:24.154
...Grooooooot!!!

00:00:26.232 --> 00:00:28.130
THE HIGH EVOLUTIONARY
I will destroy the Guardians.

00:00:28.818 --> 00:00:30.661
It is time to say goodbye.

00:00:30.712 --> 00:00:31.760
GAMORA
[Screams]

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:34.560
PETER QUILL
It's a face-off.

00:00:34.611 --> 00:00:35.971
DRAX
Yeah! Hahaha!

00:00:37.576 --> 00:00:38.777
PETER QUILL
I guess we'll die trying.

00:00:42.186 --> 00:00:43.144
GROOT
I am Groot.

00:00:43.195 --> 00:00:44.918
GAMORA
I know who you are already!

00:00:44.969 --> 00:00:45.996
ROCKET
[Laughing]

00:00:47.129 --> 00:00:47.816
PETER QUILL
Are you ready?

00:00:49.909 --> 00:00:51.254
I was eight years old when I left earth!

00:00:51.305 --> 00:00:51.965
NEBULA
You want me to drive?

00:00:52.016 --> 00:00:52.847
- No.
- I'll drive.

00:00:52.913 --> 00:00:54.440
PETER QUILL
Figure out how to put it in backwards.

00:00:56.391 --> 00:00:57.671
NEBULA
[Groans]

